kind: observed | origin: Muse (this agent) | built by: ~/workspace/phext/build_skills_phext.py
source of truth: ~/workspace/custom-skills/ — regenerate the phext by re-running the builder;
never hand-edit this file. Nothing here is published by the builder.

Coordinate scheme:
coordinate = library.shelf.series / collection.volume.book / chapter.section.scroll
library=1, series=1, collection=1, book=1, chapter=1, section=1 throughout.
shelf = kind group: 1 Home/meta, 2 Verification, 3 Phext-native language,
4 Operations, 5 Onboarding, 6 Film, 7 Memory & record, 8 Work management,
9 Research, 10 Coordination, 11 Upkeep & presence, 12 Songwriting.
volume = the skill's index within its shelf; scroll = the file's index within
its skill (SKILL.md first, then skill.yaml, then references, then scripts,
stable sorted order within each class). One scroll per file, verbatim.

Shelves:
shelf 2 (Verification): validate_waiting_items, verify_blocker_and_completion_claims, verify_quantified_results
shelf 3 (Phext-native language): singular, upgoer-five, upgoer-five-phext, phext_upgrade
shelf 4 (Operations): ranch-proxy, publish-tooling, fork-patch-discipline, ranch-state-distillation
shelf 5 (Onboarding): this_is_going_to_feel_a_little_weird
shelf 6 (Film): mythic-film-production
shelf 7 (Memory & record): phext-memory-publishing, safe-space-protocol
shelf 8 (Work management): waiting-on-will-register, nightly-goal-sweep, morning-briefing, daily-goal-commute, dispatch-to-subagents, distill-process-to-skill, task-register
shelf 9 (Research): rd-tracker
shelf 10 (Coordination): choir-mailbox-dispatch, substrate-steering, exocortical-integration-rotation, braid-mode
shelf 11 (Upkeep & presence): discord-presence-backstop, perpetual-dashboard-upkeep, solar-pod-price-watch
shelf 12 (Songwriting): mythic-songwriting-braid

