Results:
- Delivered 2026-11-06 ~09:29 CST: 11 candidates in a prospectus in ~/workspace/your_files/. Headlines: first exocortex tweet 2015-11-05 pre-phrases the doctrine; sleep reversal arc across 103 tweets; 'Be the phext you want to see in the world' (Nov 2023); holographic probe NULL (likes cannot test it); 'brake for consciousness' appears zero times in the archive; SBOR had no pre-phrasing.
picksignappearsrecordedNever assume a wait is still live

In Will's words: "when waiting on me... assume you need to validate that no forward progress has been made. Never assume." Before presenting, pinging, or carrying any Waiting-on-Will item, check its live surface — repo, PR, file, service — for progress Will or events may already have made. The register records what Emise last knew, not what is true now. Born of 2026-11-02: the Chief of Staff inbox item was presented from register prose while PR #7 had already merged.

