Hand work to the ranch cluster as often as possible. Default execution — full test suites, builds, bulk jobs — goes to ranch nodes, aletheia-core first, rather than running on the Muse VM; the VM coordinates and verifies. The nodes' thermal targets still govern how the ranch runs what it is handed.

