For every task Will submits, compute a coordinate that captures the essence of the request relative to his Singular dialect: holographically merge the request's exact words — each distinct word's holographic position from the Singular atlas, averaged component-wise, rounded half up, never below 1. The coordinate is stated when the task is acknowledged and rides with it in dispatch briefs and tracked records.

